  "description": "Construction of operating systems that manage the computer's hardware resources — processor time, memory, storage, and I/O devices — and provide services that application programs use: file storage, process execution, input/output, and memory allocation. The OS evolves from a simple monitor program through batch processing and single-user interactive systems to multi-tasking with memory protection, each stage built using tools from previous stages.",
